.TH ORO-AI-ANN 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:ai/ann \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:ai/ann'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
High\-level interface for interacting with the native artificial neural network (ANN) runtime backed by the embedded Cranium library. Provides helpers to create, train, evaluate, and persist feed\-forward neural networks directly from JavaScript.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
\fBLossFunction\fR
Supported loss function identifiers.
.TP
\fBNetwork\fR
Represents a managed ANN model within the runtime.
.TP
\fBid()\fR
Documented method exposed by this module.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fInumber \\| null\fR Unique model identifier assigned by the runtime.
.TP
\fBname()\fR
Documented method exposed by this module.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fIstring\fR Model name assigned during creation (optional).
.TP
\fBinputSize()\fR
Documented method exposed by this module.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fInumber\fR Number of input features per example.
.TP
\fBoutputSize()\fR
Documented method exposed by this module.
\fBReturns:\fR
.br
\fInumber\fR Number of output units per example.
.TP
\fBoutputActivation()\fR
Documented method exposed by this module.
\fBReturns:\fR
